            "review_title": "Review at Com Tam Thuan Kieu",
            "review_text": "Skaramoosh\nEdmonton, Canada4110 contributions\n0\nThumbs Up!\nSep 2019\nWe wanted to try Broken Rice dishes and was brought here by our guide. There's loads of different dishes but the staple for the locals is pork chop and broken rice. We went to town with our orders and ended up rolling out of this local venue.\n\nTotally enjoyed the food. The pork chops is a must try!\n\nPrice is at the higher end of the budget category. Worth every cent!\n\nRecommended!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten October 20, 2019",
