            "review_text": "ToddHata\nLos Angeles, California946 contributions\n0\nOk, Difficult for Tourists\nMar 2017 • Friends\nOur tour guide recommended this place for lunch after our walking tour. It's definitively a locals place. We tried standing in line by the food counter and got skipped for other locals behind us. Finally got them to take our order by pointing at the food we wanted, they missed one and we had to get them to get it for us. Food was ok, cheap though. For a local place I expected better food.\nRead more\nWritten March 16, 2017",
