            "review_text": "Diana N\n101 contributions\n0\nGood food but dirty\nMay 2015 • Friends\nOur taxi driver suggested this place so my friends and I ate here.\n\nThe Com Tam was very tasty and had a slight sweetness to the meat which made it stand out from other places. We also had the Asian sausages which were very tasty as well. I would of gave this place an average rating if it wasn't for the GIANT roach I saw crawling near our table. I believe the staff saw it too but carried on like it was normal. Funny thing is, we all continued eating and laughed nervously.\n\nThe food still tastes good but eat here at your own risk!\nRead more\nWritten March 9, 2016",
