            "review_text": "Mirage T\n291 contributions\n0\nWild range of choice for Vietnamese daily food\nMay 2015 • Family\nVisit this place for lunch. It's like a food court type where you get to choose your food at the counter. Just choose what you want to eat, then find a table and sit , they will bring to you. Many type of dishes, they change everyday too and all are cooked in Vietnamese way. Forget Vietnamese spring rolls or Vietnamese pancakes, try these out, these are what Vietnamese eat daily.\nGood food, nice staffs, reasonable price. Worth a try.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten September 25, 2015",
